"$PY" $LB "$B\\05_NAPE.jpg" "GD11 hair P - 05 nape: back and nape close (rear-lit), full hair and main only; row 3 strand geometry: only the long nape hair joining the bun (A) | free (B) | wisps (C) for $t" 460 "g11rpS_back_custom.png|h51a back, g11rpF_back_custom.png|$t back, g11rpS_napeB_custom.png|h51a nape, g11rpF_napeB_custom.png|$t nape" "g11rpS_back_main_custom.png|h51a back main, g11rpF_back_main_custom.png|$t back main, g11rpS_napeB_main_custom.png|h51a nape main, g11rpF_napeB_main_custom.png|$t nape main" "$PV\\tagA_$t.png|A nape join $t, $PV\\tagB_$t.png|B nape free $t, $PV\\tagC_$t.png|C nape wisps $t"
