"$PY" $LB "$B\\08_UNREAL_FINAL.jpg" "GD11 hair P - 08 Unreal final $t on the locked face package: front, 3/4, profile, back (studio / rear-lit); row 2 technical: head pitch up / down, turns and run-stop" 500 "g11rpF_front_custom.png|front, g11rpF_q3R_custom.png|3/4 R, g11rpF_q3L_custom.png|3/4 L, g11rpF_profR_custom.png|profile, g11rpF_back_custom.png|back" "g11rpP_pitchUp_side_custom.png|pitch up, g11rpP_pitchDn_side_custom.png|pitch down, g11rpmot_turnL06_q3_custom.png|turn L, g11rpmot_look85_front_custom.png|look 85, g11rpmot_stop06_back_custom.png|run-stop back"
